{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Dragon Slayer and The Leaf Town",
    "steam_appid": 3792420,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a single-player RPG, where the hero grows by defeating monsters, defeating the dragon that is harassing the townspeople, and saving the town. However, there is something suspicious about this town... What kind of secret is hidden? Let's go on an adventure with the hero and find the key to the truth!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow your character by leveling up your skills according to the skill tree!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792420/extras/61b3860113ce1f8c031dd3859d8449ca.avif?t=1752040859\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can catch monsters to collect treasures, and with the treasures you can buy cooler and stronger equipment!!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792420/extras/2bc59c3ed3607199b3e825b919f16c6b.avif?t=1752040859\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control Keys</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P: Menu, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I: Inventory, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>K: Skill Tree, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S: Equipment/Character Info, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TAB: Show/Hide Quick Slot, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: Quest List, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Esc: Close Window, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to NPC: Space, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resurrect When Dead: Left Click on You Died Window</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a single-player RPG, where the hero grows by defeating monsters, defeating the dragon that is harassing the townspeople, and saving the town. However, there is something suspicious about this town... What kind of secret is hidden? Let's go on an adventure with the hero and find the key to the truth!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow your character by leveling up your skills according to the skill tree!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792420/extras/61b3860113ce1f8c031dd3859d8449ca.avif?t=1752040859\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can catch monsters to collect treasures, and with the treasures you can buy cooler and stronger equipment!!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792420/extras/2bc59c3ed3607199b3e825b919f16c6b.avif?t=1752040859\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control Keys</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P: Menu, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I: Inventory, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>K: Skill Tree, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S: Equipment/Character Info, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TAB: Show/Hide Quick Slot, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: Quest List, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Esc: Close Window, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to NPC: Space, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resurrect When Dead: Left Click on You Died Window</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "The sacred dragon that protected the village died. After that, his son, the dragon, gradually became crooked and began to deviate. Then, he drank alcohol and completely destroyed the village. Unable to bear it any longer, the village chief asked a traveler to kill the dragon...",
